<title>GAMBIA: Gambia jail guards smuggled cannabis to inmates.</title>
<headline>Gambia jail guards smuggled cannabis to inmates.</headline>
<dateline>BANJUL 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The West African state of Gambia sacked 19 prison guards and retired their boss on Monday after finding them guilty of smuggling cannabis to the inmates, government sources said.</p>
<p>The warders worked at Mile Two Jail outside the capital Banjul.</p>
